;
; Brother QL-500 / QL-550 / QL-560 / QL-570 / QL-580N / QL-600 / QL-650TD / QL-700 / QL-710W / QL-720NW / QL-800 / QL-810W /
; QL-820NWB / QL-1050 / QL-1060N / QL-1100 / QL-1110NWB / QL-1115NWB - independent Unidrv driver (Unidrv + render plug-in) for
; ARM64 and x64, self-signed. One package: GPDs/INIs shared, the plug-in per architecture (arm64\, amd64\).
;

